Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Preserved A\[Dash]\[CurlyPhi] field diagnostics", "Title",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"732b53a8-5f52-424a-875e-e04eb150b495"],

Cell["\:7f2a\:96e8\:8f69 / Miao Yuxuan \[CenterDot] \:6dee\:5357\:5e08\:8303\
\:5b66\:9662 / Huainan Normal University", "Subtitle",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"d8c18590-abc5-f14d-8c78-27fc5f96ca71"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Model, inputs and scope", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"9c11e60d-4f80-7940-8e20-8f0ae7d51b30"],

Cell["J=\[Minus]\[Sigma](j\[Omega]A+\[Del]\[CurlyPhi]); \
\[Del]\[CenterDot]J=0", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"e39b24a4-1015-d346-91ed-d6e86d6fcb9c"],

Cell["SI; exp(+j omega t); RMS; sigma=58 MS/m; mu_r=1; 20 C", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"8ee6feeb-7ee9-5848-947e-aff079b644a5"],

Cell["\<\
Read actual saved fields and reproduce J, phi and gauge residuals. Original \
field parameters remain visible.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"c3e62f21-2c94-244d-8c43-c3e04d1acfc2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Derivation and interpretation", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"f63a8ce9-cb5f-3241-8bd2-a1e3c5212bea"],

Cell["\<\
Under exp(+j\[Omega]t), reconstruct J=\[Minus]\[Sigma](j\[Omega]A+\[Del]\
\[CurlyPhi]) from the original saved A and \[CurlyPhi] fields. Compare \
current conservation and normalized potential/gauge residuals using the exact \
preserved inputs.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"a5ff654e-51ec-8840-9b99-5a7dff829b27"],

Cell["\<\
This entry changes only diagnostic sampling density. It recomputes \
derivatives on saved fields and tests reproducibility against the original \
diagnostic quantities; it performs no new field solve.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"73fe4f9b-d5ae-2f4d-b62e-46464d3fcc75"],

Cell["\<\
The saved scalar-potential/gauge checks remain failed. Preserve mesh, \
excitation, gauge and boundary assumptions. Continue only after identifying a \
consistent formulation and passing conservation, gauge and mesh studies.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"3e60fa7c-af47-4a45-a65b-100821cf2f43"],

